{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CfrvcN7xV9ekMtTT1wKZM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both bugs are fixed in `sched/core.py`, and `tests/test_sched.py` now passes (1 passed). The signature is unchanged.\n\n**Root causes**\n\n1. **Skipped day after 22:00 UTC:** `today = now.date()` took the date in UTC, not in `tz`. At 23:30 UTC on June 1, Berlin is already June 2 at 01:30, but the code built the candidate on June 1. That candidate was in the past, so the \"advance one day\" step produced June 2 01:00 Berlin, which is also before `now`. The result was a time in the past, not the next run.\n\n2. **One-hour error around DST:** the \"advance one day\" step added `timedelta(days=1)` to the instant in UTC. A UTC day is 24 hours of elapsed time, but on a DST change day the local day is 23 or 25 hours, so the wall-clock time shifted by an hour. For example, 03:30 Berlin on March 28 plus 24 UTC hours landed on 04:30 CEST on March 29.\n\n**The fix**\n\n- The local date is now `now.astimezone(zone).date()`.\n- The candidate is built with `datetime.combine(local_date, time(hour, minute), tzinfo=zone)`.\n- When the candidate is not after `now`, the code steps the calendar date (`local_date + timedelta(days=1)`) and rebuilds the wall-clock time in the zone, instead of adding 24 hours.\n\n**Checks beyond the test**\n\n- Berlin, `now` = 2026-03-28 12:00 UTC, 03:30: returns 2026-03-29 03:30 CEST, which is 01:30 UTC. This is the DST case; the old code returned 04:30 CEST.\n- `now` = 2026-06-01 22:30 UTC, 01:00 Berlin: returns 2026-06-02 01:00 CEST, which is correct.\n\nI didn't commit anything. I didn't add a test for the DST case; if you want it in the suite, the check above can go into `tests/test_sched.py`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5438,"cache_read_input_tokens":32406,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5438},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"781c9cd9-037f-4cae-b2be-1b0b85b78534","uuid":"2fda7c40-3c61-4a24-8e7d-7131c427084b","timestamp":"2026-10-09T15:47:38.621Z","request_id":"req_011CfrvcMpqXcy8pgciLQcex"}
